  '**THE SENTENCE I WOULD PUT IN YOUR PLACE.** _He should be shown both versions and his own margin note._',
  '**THE WRITER\'S ANSWER.** ⚠ _Refused: showing a man his own margin note beside the version that removed it is a demonstration at his expense._ **He was told the finding without the note, and agreed with it.**',
